#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:129
msgid ""
"Migrator: this archive was never finished, so it is not a complete backup. "
"The run that wrote it was cut short (execution time, memory, or a full "
"disk). Nothing has been imported, this site is untouched. Restore from a "
"backup that finished."
msgstr ""

#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:145
msgid "Migrator: archive has no manifest (is this a Migrator archive?)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:149
msgid ""
"Migrator: this archive was made by a newer version of Migrator. Update the "
"plugin on this site and try again."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: the archive's table prefix, 2: this site's table prefix
#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:161
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Migrator: table prefix mismatch. This archive uses \"%1$s\" but this site "
"uses \"%2$s\". Set this site's $table_prefix to \"%1$s\" in wp-config.php "
"and try again."
msgstr ""

#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:186
msgid ""
"Migrator: this restore crosses a multisite boundary. Restoring a network "
"backup rewrites the network tables to the destination domain, which this "
"plugin does not do, so the import was stopped rather than left half applied."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: number of rows, 2: database error
#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:239
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$d rows could not be rewritten and may still point at the old address "
"(%2$s)."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: path to the SQL dump of the previous database, 2: the original error
#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:280
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Migrator: the import failed AND the rollback failed, so the database is in a "
"partly imported state. The dump of the previous database is kept at %1$s and "
"must be restored by hand. %2$s"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: the original error
#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:288
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Migrator: import failed and the database was rolled back to its previous "
"state. %s"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: number of files restored, 2: path to the SQL dump of the previous database, 3: the original error
#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:323
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Migrator: the restore stopped after the database had already been replaced, "
"so this site is now part restored: the database is the one from the archive, "
"%1$d files came across in full, the file it stopped on may be part written, "
"and the rest of the archive was not read. The database as it was before is "
"dumped at %2$s: import that file to put the database back, or restore again "
"from a backup that finished. Do one of the two before letting visitors in. "
"%3$s"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: what was wrong with the archive
#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:362
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Migrator: this archive is damaged, so nothing has been imported and this "
"site is untouched. %s"
msgstr ""

#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:381
msgid ""
"Migrator: cannot create the pre-import safety backup, so nothing has been "
"imported. Check that the backups folder is writable."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: path of the temporary SQL file
#: src/Engine/Import/Importer.php:456
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Migrator: could not write the whole SQL dump to %s. The disk is most likely "
"full. Nothing has been imported."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: source prefix, 2: this site's prefix
#: src/Engine/Import/Preflight.php:41
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Archive uses \"%1$s\" but this site uses \"%2$s\". The restore will be "
"refused until this site's $table_prefix in wp-config.php matches."
msgstr ""
"Archiwum używa „%1$s”, ale ta witryna używa „%2$s”. Przywrócenie zostanie "
"odrzucone do czasu dopasowania $table_prefix tej witryny w wp-config.php."

#. translators: %s: table prefix
#: src/Engine/Import/Preflight.php:50
#, php-format
msgid "Matches (%s)."
msgstr "Dopasowania (%s)."

#: src/Engine/Import/Preflight.php:62
msgid ""
"This archive or this site is a network. Restoring across a multisite "
